OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and breezy to start with
OL,6,Flight rain arriving across the region
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. The rain turns
OL,8,Fpatchy by the early afternoon but
OL,9,Fremaining cloudy for most. WInds
OL,10,Ffreshen later. Turning mild for the
OL,11,Ftime of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining mostly cloudy with
OL,14,Fpatchy light rain initially. The odd
OL,15,Fclear spell develops overnight with
OL,16,Fmany areas turning dry. Mild. Strong,
OL,17,Fgusty winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
