OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA band of rain, locally
OL,6,Fheavy, moves across the area. This
OL,7,Fclears by late morning, with cloud
OL,8,Fbreaking and isolated showers
OL,9,Fpossible. Remaining windy with coastal
OL,10,Fgales. Very mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FGenerally dry and partly cloudy on
OL,14,FWednesday but remaining windy. Cloudy
OL,15,Fand becoming wet and windy through
OL,16,FThursday. Drier and brighter on
OL,17,FFriday, winds easing. Mild through the
OL,18,Fperiod.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
